<title>USA: Xerox may issue $500 mln in trust preferreds.</title>
<headline>Xerox may issue $500 mln in trust preferreds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xerox Corp is rumored to be launching a $500 million trust preferred offering as early as Thursday, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The A2/A rated issue is expected to be underwritten by lead manager Merrill Lynch &amp; Co.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>((--Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
